# RAZORPAY LIVE / PRODUCTION PAYMENT GATEWAY
# 1. Sign up / Log in to your activated Razorpay account at https://dashboard.razorpay.com/
# 2. Switch mode from "Test Mode" to "Live Mode" at the top-left toggle.
# 3. Go to Account & Settings > API Keys.
# 4. Generate your Live Key (starts with "rzp_live_").
# 5. Paste it here OR configure it directly in the Admin Panel (Settings > Payment Gateway):
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_your_actual_key_here
